{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o043b","title":"张当及曹爽党被论谋反夷三族","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o043b-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"张当及曹爽党被论谋反夷三族","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o071b-account","label":"《诸夏侯曹传第九》正文","text":"公卿廷议以谋逆论曹爽等诛夷三族","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o071b-q"]},{"id":"xiahoucao-a-o108-review","label":"陈寿评","text":"陈寿认为夏侯曹氏以亲旧立功，又批曹爽德薄位尊、沉溺盈溢。","evidence":["xiahoucao-q-o108-review"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-split-e95f17a90a62","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"曹爽被诛","evidence":["houzhu-q-O053"]},{"id":"wgc-a-0-e21","label":"正文","text":"司马懿诛曹爽","evidence":["wgc-q0164","wgc-q0006"]},{"id":"wangwei-a-16b3813cbc2be529399f","label":"正文","text":"曹爽诛","evidence":["wangwei-q-91594aaa37c7f634c45a"]}],"participants":[{"person":"shaodi-p0026","role":"被收治","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0056","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0027","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0028","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0020","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"mingdi-p0028","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0029","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0030","role":"被诛","evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0023","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o071b-q"]},{"person":"shaodi-p0024","role":"被诛","evidence":["xiahoucao-e-o071b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0364","role":"诛曹爽","evidence":["wgc-q0164","wgc-q0006"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":249,"label":"戊戌","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y249","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o043","basis":"戊戌"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o043b-q","shaodi-q-o043","shaodi-q-o046","shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o043b-q","source_order":[4,181,"O043b"],"order":1054}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0028","name":"毕轨","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"mingdi-p0056","name":"曹爽","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0020","name":"何晏","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0023","name":"曹羲","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0024","name":"曹训","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0026","name":"张当","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0027","name":"丁谧","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0028","name":"邓飏","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0029","name":"李胜","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"shaodi-p0030","name":"桓范","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0364","name":"司马懿","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"houzhu-q-O053","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-4d2ab6578239f0eee393","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春正月，魏诛大将军曹爽等，右将军夏侯霸来降。","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":111,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":25,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-e-o043b-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o043","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wangwei-q-91594aaa37c7f634c45a","section":"chapter-021","block":"b-217f7a92077c8b2f0cd5","layer":"original","quote":"曹爽诛","section_title":"王卫二刘傅传第二十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0048.xhtml","index":480,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":16,"end":19,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0006","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"是时，凌外甥令狐愚以才能为兖州刺史，屯平阿〖3〗。舅甥并典兵，专淮南之重。凌就迁为司空〖4〗。司马宣王既诛曹爽，进凌为太尉，假节、钺。凌、愚密协计，谓齐王不任天位〖5〗，楚王彪长而才〖6〗，欲迎立彪都许昌。","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wgc-q0164","section":"chapter-028","block":"b-48d8a8c3b1b7a3ef24e8","layer":"original","quote":"司马宣王既诛曹爽","section_title":"王毌丘诸葛邓钟传第二十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0062.xhtml","index":22,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":47,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o071b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-650ce0d2c114d6dfb6ac","layer":"original","quote":"于是收晏等下狱，会公卿朝臣，廷议〖2〗，以为：“《春秋》之义，‘君亲无将，将而必诛’〖3〗。爽以支属〖4〗，世蒙殊宠，亲受先帝握手遗诏，托以天下；而包藏祸心，蔑弃顾命〖5〗，乃与晏、飏及当等谋图神器；范党同罪人：皆为大逆不道〖6〗。”于是收爽、羲、训、晏、飏、谧、轨、胜、范、当等，皆伏诛，夷三族。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":356,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":57,"end":206,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o108-review","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-e8aa83f31b75ca2487ba","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：夏侯、曹氏，世为婚姻。故惇、渊、仁、洪、休、尚、真等，并以亲旧肺腑〖1〗，贵重于时；左右勋业〖2〗，咸有效劳〖3〗。爽德薄位尊，沉溺盈溢〖4〗；此固大《易》所著〖5〗，道家所忌也〖6〗。玄以规格局度〖7〗，世称其名；然与曹爽中外缱绻〖8〗，荣位如斯；曾未闻匡弼其非，援致良才。举兹以论，焉能免之乎〖9〗？","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":643,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
